# /exit returns Result{Exit: true} (builtins.go): the TUI program ends and
# the terminal falls back to its own shell prompt, so there is nothing
# kiln-rendered left on screen to WAITFOR against.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/commands-baseline.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE /exit
KEY enter
WAIT 2
SHOT after-exit
EXPECT_NOT /describe a task/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
NOTE process-exit is inferred from the kiln UI disappearing from screen text, not observed directly (this driver has no PID check available to a scenario).
